# ── Generated files — collapse noisy diffs, keep them readable ────────────────
# linguist-generated hides these in GitHub diffs and language stats BY DEFAULT,
# but the diff can still be expanded — unlike `-diff`, which shows only
# "Binary files differ" and hides which dependency actually changed.
# Lockfiles stay committed and merge normally either way.
uv.lock linguist-generated
bun.lock linguist-generated
Cargo.lock linguist-generated
package-lock.json linguist-generated
pnpm-lock.yaml linguist-generated
yarn.lock linguist-generated
bun.lockb binary

# ── GitHub language stats — keep borrowed code out of the graph ───────────────
# external/** linguist-vendored
# docs/** linguist-documentation

# ── Git LFS — off on purpose ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The paired .gitignore blocks models, datasets and archives by default, so LFS
# rules would never fire. Enable only in a repository that intentionally
# versions large binaries; hosting quotas depend on provider and plan.
#   *.safetensors filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
